WEBVTT

00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:05.150
Shaolin, Shaolin...

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:09.060
The weather's nice out,
but you'll still catch a cold.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.870
<i>My gentle brother...</i>

00:00:12.730 --> 00:00:16.870
<i>If only I hadn't been born
 under an evil star...</i>

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:19.720
<i>Brother...</i>

00:00:20.980 --> 00:00:22.410
Wake up, Shaolin.

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:27.010
Sh-Shijie!

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:28.680
Good morning!

00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:30.670
It's not even morning anymore.

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:33.210
You should already be at your studies!

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:34.860
It's not like that, Shijie!

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:38.870
I'm, uh... studying in bed...

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:39.800
Drool...

00:00:40.420 --> 00:00:41.950
Don't wipe it off with your sleeves.

00:00:41.950 --> 00:00:43.150
Be more elegant!

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:50.900
I've been telling you the same thing ever 
since I got demoted to being your tutor.

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:55.560
I'm going to turn you into a 
princess that everyone respects.

00:00:55.560 --> 00:00:57.420
B-But...

00:00:57.420 --> 00:01:00.910
I just can't see that ever happening.

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:04.990
Everybody's worried about 
the star-reader's prophecy.

00:01:05.590 --> 00:01:08.910
That's why even my brother...

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:14.970
Everybody hates me!

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.940
What were you studying in bed?

00:01:18.940 --> 00:01:20.980
The divine beast.

00:01:21.290 --> 00:01:23.780
The silver-colored divine beast,

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:28.080
together with our ancestors,
 drove away disaster in the distant past.

00:01:28.080 --> 00:01:30.600
It's an old legend in our village.

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:35.600
Whoever rides on the back of the divine beast
 will be happy for the rest of their life.

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:40.840
I thought maybe I'd ride on its back and 
have it make me into a real princess!

00:01:40.840 --> 00:01:43.120
Don't rely on others to solve your problems!

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:45.280
Shijie-sama!

00:01:45.890 --> 00:01:47.870
Yusea-sama is, um...

00:01:49.360 --> 00:01:51.260
I'll be back soon.

00:01:51.260 --> 00:01:53.640
Until I get back, prepare
for your morning studies.

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:54.910
Got it?

00:01:55.460 --> 00:01:57.440
Yusea-sama's condition has...

00:01:57.440 --> 00:01:59.030
Idiot! Keep your voice down!

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:05.030
The divine beast...

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:26.250
<b>The Apathetic Boy and the Girl in a Bottle</b>

00:03:44.950 --> 00:03:49.410
<b>The Red Star of Evil and the Brilliant Ruler of Superior Flame</b>

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:56.000
No! You may not meet Yusea-sama!

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:57.650
Um...

00:03:58.250 --> 00:04:01.300
We're not here to hurt anyone.

00:04:01.650 --> 00:04:02.940
That's right!

00:04:02.940 --> 00:04:05.330
We've come to ask a question!

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:08.840
Star-reading?

00:04:08.840 --> 00:04:10.490
That's right, jamo.

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:12.780
In the Dragon Village, 
which is just up ahead,

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:15.520
live the descendants of a clan which could

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:17.860
read the stars to tell 
prophecies of the future, jamo!

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:20.340
Myu! Prophecies of the future?

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:22.900
And that could give us a
 clue to Merc's memories?

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:24.760
That, I don't know...

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:28.780
But it's considered important 
enough around here

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:31.670
that the star-readers influence 
the village's politics!

00:04:31.670 --> 00:04:33.790
Let's go to the Dragon Village!

00:04:33.790 --> 00:04:36.230
I hope we find some kind of clue.

00:04:36.230 --> 00:04:37.780
That's right!

00:04:37.780 --> 00:04:42.930
While you're doing that, I'll go to 
Tao Village nearby to do some business.

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:44.910
Tao Village?

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:51.080
A month from now, the ruler of Dragon Village

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:54.930
and the daughter of Tao Village's 
ruler will be getting married.

00:04:56.850 --> 00:05:02.250
In other words, there's definitely 
a way to make money off it, jamo!

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:08.640
I just want to talk to him!

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:13.230
No!  I've been ordered to let no one inside!

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:16.620
And we can't trust a boy who's 
got a monster with him.

00:05:19.170 --> 00:05:21.310
Go back to the kingdom!

00:05:28.030 --> 00:05:30.020
I have to find it.

00:05:34.160 --> 00:05:35.650
Did I just...

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:44.860
Would it have killed him to hear us out?

00:05:46.690 --> 00:05:49.720
There's supposedly a wedding in a month,

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:52.550
but nobody seemed in a celebratory mood.

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:53.740
And...

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:54.690
And?

00:05:55.510 --> 00:05:59.110
How did they know we were from the kingdom?

00:06:00.220 --> 00:06:02.610
I heard a scream!

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:05.140
You there!

00:06:05.140 --> 00:06:08.230
Run away!

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:18.110
Are you okay?

00:06:18.110 --> 00:06:19.110
Yeah...

00:06:19.110 --> 00:06:23.110
That monster got hurt when 
you stepped on his tail.

00:06:23.660 --> 00:06:27.900
You can tell how monsters feel...

00:06:27.900 --> 00:06:29.870
I'm trying to figure it out, I guess.

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:32.500
Are you okay, Mr. Laoshin?

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:34.870
I-I'm sorry!

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:43.370
I thought all monsters were scary.

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:45.940
They don't hurt people 
unless it's for a reason.

00:06:46.680 --> 00:06:48.590
Get off me!

00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:52.840
Yuu-san used to be scared of them, too.

00:06:55.890 --> 00:06:59.910
By the way, are you from the Dragon Village?

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:02.510
Ah! U-Um...

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:10.270
A lifetime of happiness?

00:07:10.270 --> 00:07:11.480
Yes.

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:14.350
All you need to do is ride on 
the back of the divine beast...

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:18.140
And you... get that...

00:07:18.140 --> 00:07:19.340
Are you okay?

00:07:19.340 --> 00:07:21.300
Are you not feeling well?

00:07:21.300 --> 00:07:23.510
U-Um, I'm sorry.

00:07:23.510 --> 00:07:28.400
I've never really talked 
to anybody but Shijie.

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:29.670
Who's Shijie?

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:33.150
My tutor.

00:07:33.150 --> 00:07:37.810
I've spent my whole life 
forced to study alone.

00:07:37.810 --> 00:07:39.680
Why alone?

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:46.180
Because... the star-readers said I 
was born under the Red Star of Evil.

00:07:46.180 --> 00:07:47.530
Star-readers?

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:50.940
What's the Red Star of Evil?

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:54.200
The Star of Red Disaster...

00:07:54.940 --> 00:07:57.440
If I'm around, disaster will come.

00:07:57.820 --> 00:08:03.060
But Shijie said it's not true.

00:08:03.060 --> 00:08:07.960
I have to become a 
great princess instead.

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:13.290
But I'm still scared, so I went 
to look for the divine beast.

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:15.970
The beast of the gods, huh?

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:20.340
Can we help you find it?

00:08:21.480 --> 00:08:23.740
Please!

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:26.280
Really?

00:08:26.280 --> 00:08:30.230
After hearing what you said,
 I want to meet it.

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:34.890
Thank you!

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:39.260
I was actually... really scared to be alone!

00:08:40.860 --> 00:08:45.630
So, do you know where the 
divine beast might be?

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:50.870
Um, the divine beast is probably...

00:08:50.870 --> 00:08:51.860
This way?

00:08:52.290 --> 00:08:53.850
No, this way?

00:08:55.240 --> 00:08:58.400
Hey, you're holding that 
scroll upside-down.

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:04.830
I know I taught you how to read a map.

00:09:05.620 --> 00:09:07.470
Sh-Shijie!

00:09:11.240 --> 00:09:14.940
You really are far more 
active than you'd think.

00:09:15.670 --> 00:09:17.270
Aren't you supposed to be studying?

00:09:17.270 --> 00:09:21.550
Um, I decided to go on a field trip.

00:09:23.490 --> 00:09:24.860
I see.

00:09:25.240 --> 00:09:27.420
To find the divine beast?

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:28.140
Gulp.

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:30.620
She can't keep secrets from him.

00:09:30.620 --> 00:09:34.370
I'm not going back until 
I find the divine beast.

00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:39.930
Then do your research first so you 
at least know where you're going.

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:41.800
This way.

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:43.800
Shijie...

00:09:44.190 --> 00:09:46.550
This is still a field trip.

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:52.390
The monsters around here have 
been especially active lately.

00:09:52.390 --> 00:09:55.200
I'm sorry to get you caught up 
in this, but please help us.

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:56.780
No, it's okay.

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:58.230
Happy to help!

00:09:58.230 --> 00:10:00.560
You know where to go, Shijie?

00:10:00.560 --> 00:10:01.900
Of course I do.

00:10:01.900 --> 00:10:05.230
I am <i>extremely</i> talented, after all.

00:10:05.710 --> 00:10:07.100
Let's go.

00:10:08.950 --> 00:10:11.920
<i>And there's something I want to see, too.</i>

00:10:38.730 --> 00:10:42.000
You have a brother, Shaolin?

00:10:42.000 --> 00:10:42.750
Yup.

00:10:43.890 --> 00:10:46.720
My brother Yusea is the 
leader of Dragon Village.

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:48.630
I'm very proud of him!

00:10:48.630 --> 00:10:49.930
He's so cool,

00:10:49.930 --> 00:10:51.910
and he runs the whole village by himself.

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:54.330
And he's so nice to me, too!

00:10:54.330 --> 00:10:57.430
You love him, don't you?

00:10:58.580 --> 00:10:59.430
Yeah.

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:04.040
Did you find where to go?

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:05.400
We're almost there.

00:11:12.340 --> 00:11:15.200
Shijie, are we there yet?

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:18.280
This was your idea.

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:20.460
If you want to be a great princess,

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:21.690
then shut up and walk!

00:11:22.750 --> 00:11:24.950
Princesses get carried in a litter!

00:11:25.650 --> 00:11:27.280
Let's take a little break.

00:11:29.260 --> 00:11:31.050
I'll go ahead a little and take a look.

00:11:31.600 --> 00:11:33.230
We're almost there.

00:11:38.950 --> 00:11:41.310
Hey, Shijie...

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:42.550
Shijie?

00:11:42.980 --> 00:11:44.060
Shijie!

00:11:49.050 --> 00:11:52.070
Shijie, I'm sorry.

00:11:52.070 --> 00:11:57.020
I really do bring disaster.

00:11:57.020 --> 00:12:00.030
It's not your fault, Shaolin-san.

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:06.560
On the day I was born, the star-readers 
saw the Red Star of Evil.

00:12:07.310 --> 00:12:13.300
Ever since then, I was kept in the mansion
 so I wouldn't cause problems for others.

00:12:13.840 --> 00:12:18.010
So... I've never really 
talked to my brother.

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:21.270
I've just watched him from afar.

00:12:23.340 --> 00:12:28.020
The only one who took my hand 
without hesitation was Shijie.

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:34.120
And I've heard my brother isn't healthy...

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:40.700
If I find the divine beast,
I thought it might heal him, too.

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:45.200
Do you believe you were born 
under a star of disaster?

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:48.410
Shijie says not to worry about it,

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:51.360
but in the village, the words of 
the star-readers are absolute.

00:12:52.400 --> 00:12:54.640
I'll go alone the rest of the way.

00:12:54.640 --> 00:12:57.370
That's crazy!

00:12:58.390 --> 00:13:01.000
If I'm going to bring sorrow to everyone,

00:13:01.000 --> 00:13:02.730
I'd rather be alone forever.

00:13:05.430 --> 00:13:08.460
You can't be happy alone.

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:11.920
You have to be with everyone else!

00:13:11.920 --> 00:13:14.260
That's right. We all came this far,

00:13:14.260 --> 00:13:15.910
so let's all go see the 
divine beast together!

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:22.200
Why are you so nice?

00:13:22.620 --> 00:13:25.560
I can't do anything for you in return!

00:13:25.890 --> 00:13:29.220
If you cry that much,
your eyes will swell up.

00:13:29.220 --> 00:13:31.160
Stop whining.

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:36.820
I didn't collapse because of your disaster.

00:13:37.620 --> 00:13:39.010
Shijie?

00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:41.210
Your eye...

00:13:42.870 --> 00:13:46.000
I'm a descendant of the star-readers' clan.

00:13:46.530 --> 00:13:48.610
But I don't have much of their blood.

00:13:48.610 --> 00:13:51.880
I have only a small amount 
of their power in one eye.

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:54.640
It uses a lot of my strength.

00:13:55.250 --> 00:13:57.510
I'll just come out and tell you.

00:13:57.900 --> 00:14:03.090
The star-reader who prophesied that 
you'd bring disaster was my father.

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:08.760
You were torn from your beloved 
brother because of my father.

00:14:08.760 --> 00:14:11.290
You were forced to spend your life alone.

00:14:11.290 --> 00:14:13.770
B-But you...

00:14:14.290 --> 00:14:16.420
If you want to hate someone, hate me.

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:19.100
N-No...

00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:20.940
Wait!

00:14:32.390 --> 00:14:35.770
<b>The Apathetic Boy and the Girl in a Bottle</b>

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:43.050
Why?

00:14:43.900 --> 00:14:44.770
Why?

00:14:45.640 --> 00:14:46.600
Shijie...

00:14:47.600 --> 00:14:48.910
Brother...

00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:52.950
What is this voice?

00:14:54.220 --> 00:14:55.130
A monster!

00:14:59.750 --> 00:15:01.490
Are you okay?!

00:15:01.490 --> 00:15:02.680
Shijie...

00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:09.420
I can't do anything for you, Shijie.

00:15:09.420 --> 00:15:10.480
So why?

00:15:10.480 --> 00:15:11.290
Because...

00:15:11.290 --> 00:15:13.390
It's because you want to atone, right?

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:15.940
Because of what your father did.

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:19.880
I don't want you with me 
out of guilt or sympathy!

00:15:19.880 --> 00:15:20.560
Who the hell...

00:15:21.570 --> 00:15:27.770
Who the hell would look after a 
pain-in-the-ass kid like you out of sympathy?!

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:30.080
It was...

00:15:30.580 --> 00:15:33.650
It was all because I love you!

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:36.880
Did you think that's what 
I was going to say, idiot?

00:15:36.880 --> 00:15:39.780
It's all so I can get a promotion!

00:15:40.580 --> 00:15:44.490
Listen. You're dumb, so I'll 
just come out and say it.

00:15:44.490 --> 00:15:47.710
I don't try to help those with no potential.

00:15:48.040 --> 00:15:51.080
You and I are going to succeed together!

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:55.710
Shijie, you... dummy!

00:15:56.230 --> 00:15:57.800
You're the dummy.

00:16:00.880 --> 00:16:03.240
Well, I'm glad.

00:16:03.240 --> 00:16:04.160
Yeah.

00:16:05.020 --> 00:16:08.620
Mr. Fokeyron! You're still here?

00:16:11.810 --> 00:16:14.730
Looks like he's hungry.

00:16:15.130 --> 00:16:16.730
I have something good for you...

00:16:16.730 --> 00:16:17.810
Hey!

00:16:20.670 --> 00:16:23.710
I brought it to eat on the way.

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:25.300
You can have it!

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:32.070
That's why he was in bad mood.

00:16:32.070 --> 00:16:33.310
Yeah...

00:16:37.680 --> 00:16:38.680
What's wrong?

00:16:39.210 --> 00:16:41.440
So it was today?

00:16:41.780 --> 00:16:42.840
Today?

00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:45.910
Monsters are heading toward the village.

00:16:47.850 --> 00:16:53.080
I sensed it was coming, so I had 
the village prepare, but...

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:56.700
If I'm here, I can't tell them.

00:16:57.080 --> 00:16:58.020
I'll go.

00:16:59.130 --> 00:17:02.120
I can't ask an outsider 
to save the village.

00:17:02.120 --> 00:17:03.780
Don't worry about it.

00:17:04.160 --> 00:17:05.440
Thank you.

00:17:05.440 --> 00:17:06.550
Wait!

00:17:06.550 --> 00:17:09.560
I'll go, too. I'm worried about my brother.

00:17:09.560 --> 00:17:10.740
No!

00:17:10.740 --> 00:17:15.250
If you go now, everyone will believe you 
were born under the Red Star of Evil!

00:17:16.270 --> 00:17:17.420
It'll be fine.

00:17:17.860 --> 00:17:20.140
You take care of Shijie.

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:34.230
Monsters are here!

00:17:40.630 --> 00:17:42.750
We're almost there.

00:17:43.550 --> 00:17:45.650
Can we make it?

00:17:48.110 --> 00:17:49.630
I'm okay now.

00:17:49.630 --> 00:17:50.790
I've calmed down.

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:52.350
Good.

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:54.490
We need to hurry.

00:17:54.490 --> 00:17:56.150
Don't push yourself.

00:17:57.880 --> 00:17:59.830
What's wrong, Fokeyron?

00:17:59.830 --> 00:18:02.820
I saw this light with my star-reading!

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:09.260
They're coming! Get your bows ready!

00:18:09.260 --> 00:18:10.560
Wait!

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:13.700
We need to heal the monsters first!

00:18:13.700 --> 00:18:14.760
Right!

00:18:14.760 --> 00:18:17.080
Merc, Toto, you two hide somewhere.

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:20.080
<i>There're so many... Can I heal them all?</i>

00:18:33.690 --> 00:18:35.230
<i>Concern?</i>

00:18:46.220 --> 00:18:47.680
Run away!

00:18:47.680 --> 00:18:51.810
No! The Lambherns aren't out of control!

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:56.030
What?

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:58.860
Let's attack! Or they'll kill us!

00:18:58.860 --> 00:18:59.990
Stop!

00:19:02.210 --> 00:19:03.280
That's...

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:05.280
A silver...

00:19:06.840 --> 00:19:09.130
The divine beast!

00:19:10.260 --> 00:19:13.620
And on its back... Shaolin-sama?

00:19:13.620 --> 00:19:15.540
Withdraw the troops.

00:19:15.540 --> 00:19:19.280
We can't fight the monsters 
without knowing what's going on.

00:19:19.280 --> 00:19:20.550
Yusea-sama!

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:36.310
<i>Brother...</i>

00:19:36.780 --> 00:19:39.500
I'm glad it worked out, Shaolin.

00:19:43.430 --> 00:19:46.800
A sick Lambhern child 
wandered into the village

00:19:46.800 --> 00:19:49.300
and was living in one of 
the mansion's annexes.

00:19:49.880 --> 00:19:53.040
And the parents just wanted to see it again.

00:19:53.540 --> 00:19:56.220
When it got better, the child 
called out to its parents.

00:19:56.710 --> 00:20:00.450
And they went searching for it.

00:20:00.930 --> 00:20:03.330
I should've noticed earlier.

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:05.050
It's my fault.

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:10.090
I can't believe the divine beast 
was actually this monster!

00:20:10.090 --> 00:20:12.260
What a surprise!

00:20:12.700 --> 00:20:17.980
When the sunlight hits its coat, 
it turned from red to silver.

00:20:17.980 --> 00:20:20.630
It's such a pretty monster, isn't it?

00:20:20.630 --> 00:20:21.730
Shaolin...

00:20:22.970 --> 00:20:25.200
You're all grown up.

00:20:29.860 --> 00:20:31.550
No, Shaolin.

00:20:32.120 --> 00:20:34.490
It's all my fault.

00:20:36.470 --> 00:20:40.510
Yusea-sama was said to bring 
prosperity to the dragon.

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:43.650
But his body also drains the ki,

00:20:43.650 --> 00:20:48.060
the energy all living things have,
 from those around him.

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:53.510
Those who touch me become miserable.

00:20:55.390 --> 00:20:58.230
Why do you try to carry that burden alone?

00:20:58.230 --> 00:21:00.940
Why didn't you tell me?

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:02.940
Shaolin...

00:21:02.940 --> 00:21:06.440
I want to share your burdens.

00:21:06.440 --> 00:21:08.320
If we all take each other's hands,

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:12.410
the unhappiness will disappear!

00:21:13.700 --> 00:21:14.840
Thank you.

00:21:23.530 --> 00:21:28.320
You sure you didn't want the star-readers 
to try and look at your memories?

00:21:28.320 --> 00:21:32.440
Shijie-san said their power isn't perfect.

00:21:32.440 --> 00:21:34.270
Yeah, but...

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:38.080
And just getting a hint that 
easily would feel like cheating.

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:40.480
It would spoil the fun of the journey!

00:21:40.480 --> 00:21:42.650
What do you mean, "fun"?

00:21:43.620 --> 00:21:47.590
I can't believe you don't 
understand what I mean!

00:21:47.590 --> 00:21:49.850
I can't help if I don't understand it.

00:23:25.480 --> 00:23:26.800
It's me, Titi!

00:23:26.800 --> 00:23:27.740
It's me, Chacha!

00:23:27.740 --> 00:23:29.220
Ryun Li-san is so wonderful!

00:23:29.220 --> 00:23:29.800
Yeah!

00:23:29.800 --> 00:23:32.170
If the people of Dragon Village 
all take each others' hands,

00:23:32.170 --> 00:23:34.170
they can make a wonderful new future.

00:23:34.170 --> 00:23:34.970
Right?

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:39.970
<b>The Lord with You in Dreams and the Town of Oblivion (Part 1)</b>

00:23:35.310 --> 00:23:38.350
Next time: "The Lord with You in Dreams 
and the Town of Oblivion."

00:23:38.340 --> 00:23:39.840
Part 1!
